From: mitzev <ogi@kunasystems.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Apr 2026 23:23:47 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 06/42] Symbol mangling: Itanium + Swift dispatch modules

Adds itanium.rs and swift.rs to rustc_symbol_mangling; the library's
symbol_name path now routes ExternAbi::Cpp / ExternAbi::Swift items to
the matching ABI's mangler (Itanium via rustc_abi_cxx::mangle; Swift's
own runtime mangling for class and struct descriptors).
